{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which one of the following is equal to 17?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/c/0cc0f4282fc0d6df70641a3222ee6d1fa78e9e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 - 4 \\times 5 + 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\times 4 + 5 \\div 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 + 4 \\times 5 - 6  \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\div 4 + 5 - 6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3 \\times 4 \\div 5 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"821\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can try the different answer choices from A to D, starting from A:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d22d446bcfd98acbc622f1628a54cda20b822ea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 4 \\times 5 + 6 = 3 - 20 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"210\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/9/909b15ea9f14db52f3f8aeafdfecd104560e4b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=-17 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/5967d33bc5dbf5c04e76824a350e76408dd79cba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>This is <i>not</i> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so we should move on to B:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe8a7ddf45a43af2e43e859e482ab7df50f4653a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 4 + 5 \\div 6 = 12 + \\text{ a non-integer positive real number}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> plus some non-integer value, so it cannot be an integer like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. This means that this value is <i>not</i> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so we should move on to C:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d82d222753ad683abccf6e06ddd86bb16f4b43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 4 \\times 5 - 6 = 3 + 20 - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"210\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f68014451d7107ac9e871798c94bce9355fa22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=23 - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c603cb975c1facd0de2983dc501a5c30f3d5c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/627ac31335978a083929ce43be2d0a69e16717fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 3 + 4 \\times 5 - 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"151\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (G